{"ticker":"LMT","updated":"2026-10-30T22:57:00Z","profile":{"longName":"Lockheed Martin Corporation","shortName":"Lockheed Martin Corporation","sector":"Industrials","industry":"Aerospace & Defense","country":"United States","website":"https://www.lockheedmartin.com","fullTimeEmployees":123000,"marketCap":147138412544,"trailingPE":22.618963,"forwardPE":19.14166,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.8597807,"pegRatio":1.2,"targetMeanPrice":652.5714,"targetHighPrice":835.0,"targetLowPrice":498.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":21,"recommendationKey":"buy","revenueGrowth":0.113,"earningsGrowth":0.147,"grossMargins":0.11732,"operatingMargins":0.11405,"profitMargins":0.082320005,"totalRevenue":79116001280,"beta":0.095,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":692.0,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":437.25,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NYQ","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":2.24},"summary":"Lockheed Martin Corporation, an aerospace and defense company, engages in the research, design, development, manufacture, integration, and sustainment of technology systems, products, and services in the United States, Europe, Asia, the Middle East, and internationally. The company operates through four segments: Aeronautics; Missiles and Fire Control (MFC); Rotary and Mission Systems (RMS); and Space. The Aeronautics segment offers combat and air mobility aircraft, unmanned air vehicles, and related technologies. The MFC segment provides air and missile defense systems; tactical missiles and precision strike weapon systems; logistics; fire control systems; mission operations support, readiness, engineering support, and integration services; and ground vehicles. The RMS segment offers military and commercial helicopters, surface ships, sea- and land-based missile defense systems, radar and laser systems, sea- and air-based mission and combat systems, command and control mission solutions, cyber solutions, simulation and training solutions, and services and support for surface ships. The Space segment provides satellites; space transportation systems; strategic, advanced strike, and defensive systems; and classified systems and services in support of national security systems. This segment also provides network-enabled situational awareness; and integrates space and ground globa","summary_zh":"洛克希德馬丁公司是一家航空航太和國防公司，在美國、歐洲、亞洲、中東和國際上從事技術系統、產品和服務的研究、設計、開發、製造、整合和維護。該公司透過四個部門運作：航空；飛彈和火控（MFC）；旋轉和任務系統（RMS）；和空間。航空部門提供戰鬥和空中機動飛機、無人機和相關技術。 MFC部門提供防空和飛彈防禦系統；戰術飛彈和精確打擊武器系統；後勤;火控系統；任務行動支援、準備、工程支援和整合服務；和地面車輛。 RMS部門提供軍用和商用直升機、水面艦艇、海基和陸基飛彈防禦系統、雷達和雷射系統、海基和空基任務和作戰系統、指揮和控制任務解決方案、網路解決方案、模擬和訓練解決方案以及水面艦艇服務和支援。太空部分提供衛星；太空運輸系統；戰略、先進的打擊和防禦系統；以及支援國家安全系統的機密系統和服務。該部分還提供基於網路的態勢感知；並整合空間和地面全球","sector_zh":"工業","industry_zh":"航空航太與國防","candles":[{"t":"2025-09-02","o":453.8,"h":455.77,"l":447.59,"c":452.5,"v":1645600},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":451.07,"h":452.0,"l":446.69,"c":449.06,"v":1541800},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":450.96,"h":457.17,"l":449.5,"c":456.85,"v":1449200},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":456.77,"h":463.98,"l":456.77,"c":463.9,"v":1465200},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":462.93,"h":462.93,"l":452.77,"c":459.11,"v":1477600},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":457.61,"h":457.87,"l":452.42,"c":457.06,"v":1008400},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":456.21,"h":464.38,"l":455.71,"c":463.87,"v":1076900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":463.85,"h":472.4,"l":462.99,"c":470.73,"v":1623700},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":468.93,"h":472.98,"l":467.17,"c":471.31,"v":1041100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":471.47,"h":474.29,"l":468.99,"c":473.25,"v":1148300},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":473.59,"h":478.44,"l":471.67,"c":474.32,"v":1156900},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":474.93,"h":477.19,"l":472.64,"c":473.12,"v":1016500},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":471.12,"h":474.36,"l":467.99,"c":473.62,"v":1107700},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":474.23,"h":477.0,"l":471.38,"c":472.94,"v":2839100},{"t":"2025-09-22","o":473.67,"h":482.07,"l":473.01,"c":480.39,"v":1409800},{"t":"2025-09-23","o":480.9,"h":486.78,"l":479.34,"c":486.67,"v":1135500},{"t":"2025-09-24","o":487.15,"h":495.24,"l":485.51,"c":486.25,"v":1424200},{"t":"2025-09-25","o":489.58,"h":490.74,"